---
import EnglishSiteLayout from "../../layouts/EnglishSiteLayout.astro";
---
<EnglishSiteLayout
  title="Legal disclaimer | Canapalandia"
  description="Canapalandia disclaimer: informational purpose, limits of medical and legal content, sources, affiliations and site tools."
  canonical="/en/disclaimer/"
  alternateIt="/disclaimer-legale-canapalandia/"
>
  <article class="en-institutional">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p>
      <h1>Legal disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="lead">Canapalandia provides information and helps readers navigate complex topics, but it does not replace professionals, public authorities, laboratories or official legal sources.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Editorial purpose</h2>
      <p>Canapalandia is an editorial project focused on hemp, CBD, cannabis light, research, culture, markets and regulation. Published content is intended for information, cultural discussion and in-depth analysis.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>No medical or healthcare advice</h2>
      <p>Articles that mention studies, biological effects, safety, wellness or therapeutic uses do not constitute diagnosis, prescriptions or personal healthcare recommendations. Health decisions should be discussed with a qualified healthcare professional and checked against the relevant official sources.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>No legal advice</h2>
      <p>Information about laws, court decisions, regulations, inspections and administrative proceedings does not constitute legal advice. Rules on hemp and cannabinoids can change quickly and may depend on the product category, intended use, jurisdiction and specific circumstances. Before making decisions with legal consequences, check current official sources or consult a qualified professional.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Scientific research, sources and updates</h2>
      <p>A scientific study does not automatically amount to definitive proof, a healthcare authorization or a recommendation for use. Where possible, Canapalandia distinguishes preliminary findings, assessments by public authorities, literature reviews and more established conclusions.</p>
      <p>We aim to prioritize official documents, public authorities, legal texts and scientific publications. Content can nevertheless become outdated or contain errors. Documented reports are reviewed and, when necessary, content is corrected or updated.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Canapalandia Lab and other tools</h2>
      <p>Canapalandia Lab is an automated tool that helps read selected data from certificates of analysis. It does not verify the authenticity of a certificate, certify a laboratory or product, or determine legality, safety, quality or suitability for consumption. Results depend on the text recognized and on the rules supported by the tool.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Advertising, affiliations and partners</h2>
      <p>The site may contain advertising, affiliate links, partnerships and sponsored content. Where applicable, the commercial nature of the content is disclosed. An affiliate link may generate a commission for Canapalandia at no additional cost to the user. Commercial relationships do not constitute a guarantee of third-party products or services.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Corrections and reports</h2>
      <p>To report an error, an updated source or another issue, use the <a href="/en/contact/">Contact page</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@canapalandia.com">info@canapalandia.com</a>. Where possible, include the page URL and the source supporting the requested correction.</p>
      <p class="note">Last substantial update: 11 August 2026.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</EnglishSiteLayout>
<style>
  .en-institutional{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 0 5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--brand);font:700 .78rem/1.2 Archivo,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.en-institutional h1{margin:.35rem 0 1rem;font:500 clamp(3rem,7vw,5.4rem)/.95 Newsreader,serif}.lead{font-size:1.14rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.en-institutional section{margin-top:2.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:1.25rem}.en-institutional h2{font:500 1.95rem/1.1 Newsreader,serif}.en-institutional p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.72}.en-institutional a{color:var(--brand);font-weight:700}.note{padding:.8rem 1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--brand);background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--panel) 82%,transparent)}
</style>
